sequenceDiagram
    title SD-05 - Grade Finalization
    participant P0 as Authorized Staff
    participant P1 as Finalization UI
    participant P2 as Grade Service
    participant P3 as Grade Repository
    participant P4 as Database
    P0->>P1: Request finalization for section subject + term
    P1->>P2: finalizeGrades(context)
    P2->>P2: Check permission + term-year match
    P2->>P3: beginTransaction(), lock context
    P3->>P4: Read grades + components + status
    P4->>P3: Snapshot / missing scores
    P2->>P2: Validate completeness and configured weights
    P2->>P3: createFinalization()
    P3->>P4: INSERT finalization, COMMIT
    P4->>P3: Success / rollback
    P3->>P2: Finalization result
    Note over P2: alt: finalized or rejected
    P1->>P0: Display locked status / errors
